' The help pages' words, English (SP-0168, CONTEXT-HELP rule 13). HelpStrings is one module in five files,
' one per language, in the same key order; Localization.GetDict merges them into the tables the UI reads,
' so a help page, the UI and a tooltip draw on one source. Same rules as Localization.vb: "key|value", no
' "|" in a value, plain "-" and "..", English as the fallback. A step names a part of the window as
' [element-id]; the generator turns it into the part's number.
